USAGE

  maia shell [command]
     Manage shells

COMMANDS

  list
    List monitored shells.

  create [<name>]
    Create a named monitored and interactive shell.

  delete [<name>]
    Delete a named monitored shell.

  remove
    Alias of delete.

  enter [<name>]
    Enter a named monitored shell.

  interactive (default)
     Start an interactive shell with some extra help functionality in place.

